						<view class="demo-section__copy">
							<text class="demo-section__title">背景</text>
							<text class="demo-section__desc">bgColor 只给留白本身铺色；要分割线时仍用 border 或 divider。</text>
						</view>
					</view>
					<view class="demo-ws-stage">
						<view class="demo-ws-band">
							<view class="demo-ws-band__head">
								<text class="demo-ws-band__name">primary-soft</text>
								<text class="demo-ws-band__meta">height 8px</text>
							</view>
							<vx-white-space height="8px" bg-color="var(--vx-color-primary-soft)" />
						</view>
						<view class="demo-ws-band">
							<view class="demo-ws-band__head">
								<text class="demo-ws-band__name">default-soft</text>
								<text class="demo-ws-band__meta">height 12px</text>
							</view>
							<vx-white-space height="12px" bg-color="var(--vx-color-default-soft)" />
						</view>
						<view class="demo-ws-band demo-ws-band--last">
							<view class="demo-ws-band__head">
								<text class="demo-ws-band__name">#ede7ff</text>
								<text class="demo-ws-band__meta">height 16px</text>
							</view>
							<vx-white-space height="16px" bg-color="#ede7ff" />
						</view>
					</view>
					<text class="demo-hint demo-ws-hint">自定义颜色是字面值；跟主题时传 var(--vx-color-*)。不要拿它表达状态，也不要代替分割线。</text>
				</view>

				<view class="demo-section">
					<view class="demo-section__head">
						<view class="demo-section__num">
							<text class="demo-section__num-text">06</text>
						</view>
						<view class="demo-section__copy">
							<text class="demo-section__title">组合</text>
							<text class="demo-section__desc">左右交给 wing-blank，上下交给 white-space，同一个方向只留一次。</text>
						</view>
					</view>
					<vx-section title="页面区块" description="标题栏不包内容，间距由下面的留白排。" marker />
					<vx-white-space size="md" />
					<vx-wing-blank size="lg">
						<vx-card title="组合卡片" meta="0.36.0"
							content="左右由 wing-blank 收进，上下由 white-space 分开。"
							footer="同一个方向只留一次，嵌套时数清楚边距。" />
					</vx-wing-blank>
					<vx-white-space height="24px" />
					<view class="demo-ws-compose">
						<text class="demo-ws-compose__title">什么时候用哪一个</text>
						<vx-white-space size="sm" />
						<text class="demo-ws-compose__body">只差纵向用 white-space；只差横向用 wing-blank；两个方向都要收时先放 wing-blank，再在内容里放 white-space。</text>
					</view>
					<text class="demo-hint demo-ws-hint">两个组件都不画外框、不加外部间距；卡片、描边和底色仍由 vx-card 或页面容器提供。</text>
				</view>

				<view class="demo-page-nav">
					<view class="demo-page-nav__item"
						:class="prevPath === '' ? 'demo-page-nav__item--disabled' : ''"
						hover-class="demo-page-nav__item--pressed" @click="goPrev">
						<text class="demo-page-nav__label">上一个</text>
						<text class="demo-page-nav__name">{{ prevName }}</text>
					</view>
					<view class="demo-page-nav__item demo-page-nav__item--next"
						:class="nextPath === '' ? 'demo-page-nav__item--disabled' : ''"
						hover-class="demo-page-nav__item--pressed" @click="goNext">
						<text class="demo-page-nav__label">下一个</text>
						<text class="demo-page-nav__name">{{ nextName }}</text>
